\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  O helper, come and give us help,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj For You are capable, O Lord;
\par Your strength and your discerning pow'r
\par Are inexplicable to man
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2. O helper, come and give us help,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 For, only You, my Lord and King,
\par That has the will to rescue us;
\par So make us cling to you always.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  O helper, come and give us help;
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 O God, dependable and true;
\par 'cause of your fatherly passion,
\par You will not ever forsake us.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   4. O helper, come and give as help;
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 You are our Almighty Amen.
\par When evils of the dark arise,
\par In daylight, you cause to recede.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  So, intercede for all mankind,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0 As you deem fit before your eyes;
\par Do intercede for me as well,
\par While I am in this worldly woes.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par   6.   Your love, your pow'r are manifest,
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0  And you make your word manifest;
\par  Therefore I'll thank you everyday;
\par \pard        Come Jesus, come and give me help.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

